OL,3,ABadenoch says Tories would scrap
OL,4,Ainheritance tax on family homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservative Party leader Kemi Badenoch
OL,7,Fhas pledged to scrap inheritance tax
OL,8,F(IHT) on family homes while also
OL,9,Fallowing couples to leave #1m tax-free,
OL,10,Fin her keynote speech at the party's
OL,11,Fconference in Birmingham.
OL,13,FBadenoch added her ambition would be
OL,14,Ffor a Conservative government to
OL,15,Fabolish IHT "as soon as we can afford
OL,16,Fit", but said she could not currently
OL,17,Fpropose this due to spending
OL,18,Fcommitments on defence, prisons and the
OL,19,Feconomy.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
