OL,3,AMan jailed for killing ex days after
OL,4,Aearly release
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe had been released on licence from
OL,7,FHMP Wandsworth on 17 October 2025 after
OL,8,Fbeing sentenced the day before to a
OL,9,F12-month jail term for possession of a
OL,10,Fbladed article and harassment. He had
OL,11,Fbeen in prison on remand since May 2025
OL,12,Fwhen he was freed.
OL,14,FSabat, of Balham, was jailed for life
OL,15,Fwith a minimum term of 17 years.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/40
