OL,3,AFrance halts use of stun grenades after
OL,4,Aboy's hand blown off in student
OL,5,Aprotests
OL,6,
OL,7,FFrance has suspended the use of stun
OL,8,Fgrenades for policing student protests
OL,9,Fthat have swept the country, after a
OL,10,F15-year-old's hand was blown off
OL,11,Fearlier this week.
OL,13,FInterior Minister Laurent Nunez said he
OL,14,Fhad requested the pause until the facts
OL,15,Fof Monday's incident in Lens had been
OL,16,F"clarified", with conflicting accounts
OL,17,Foffered by protesters and officials.
OL,19,FThe disruption continued on Wednesday
OL,20,Fwith more than 500 schools fully or
OL,21,Fpartially shut.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/40
