OL,3,AFormer hostage recalls Nova festival
OL,4,A'horror' as 7 October memorials held in
OL,5,AIsrael and across world
OL,6,
OL,7,FIsraelis are marking three years since
OL,8,Fthe Hamas-led attack on 7 October 2023,
OL,9,Fin which about 1,200 people were killed
OL,10,Fand 251 others were taken hostage
OL,12,FMemorials are being held across Israel
OL,13,Fand the world, with a vigil taking
OL,14,Fplace in central London early on
OL,15,FWednesday evening
OL,17,F"You live through it in your body and
OL,18,Fyour soul," Sharone Lifschitz, whose
OL,19,Ffather was killed after both parents
OL,20,Fwere taken hostage, tells our
OL,21,Fcorrespondent at the vigil
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
