OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFormer hostage recalls Nova festival
OL,4,A'horror' as 7 October memorials held in
OL,5,AIsrael and across world
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn event has also been held at the site
OL,8,Fof the Nova music festival, where 378
OL,9,Fpeople were killed and 44 taken
OL,10,Fhostage. Moran Stella Yanai, a former
OL,11,Fhostage taken from the festival, says
OL,12,F"happiness turned into horror" that day
OL,14,FCommemorations in Israel began with a
OL,15,Fnationwide minute's silence at 06:29
OL,16,Flocal time (04:29 BST), to mark the
OL,17,Ftime the attacks started
OL,19,FIn Tel Aviv, people stopped their cars
OL,20,Fto pay their respects with the city
OL,21,Fholding a ceremony later tonight
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
